# Normalise line endings in the repo, always.
#
# Without this the repo drifts: HEAD stores LF while a Windows/WSL checkout
# rewrites files as CRLF, so files sit permanently "modified" with no content
# change. Measured here on 2026-09-01: 420 files showed as modified and a
# 26-line change to src/types/jobs.ts rendered as 1,137 changed lines. That
# buries real diffs and invites someone to commit the noise, flipping the repo
# to CRLF in a codebase that is built and served on Linux (node:22 -> nginx).
#
# The backend repo already carries this file; the two are kept identical apart
# from the asset list below.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary - never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary

# Lockfiles: real content, but never worth a manual merge.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
package-lock.json -diff
